      "kind": "theorem",
      "name": "original_normalized_upper_tail",
      "qualifiedName": "Shao.OQ6.OriginalNormalizedUpperTail.original_normalized_upper_tail",
      "head": "theorem original_normalized_upper_tail\n    (n : ℕ) (hn : 0 < n) {Ω : Type*} [mΩ : MeasurableSpace Ω]\n    (μ : Measure Ω) [hμ : IsProbabilityMeasure μ]\n    (g : Ω → ℝ) (hg : Measurable g) (hg2 : MemLp g 2 μ)\n    (hgmean : (∫ o : Ω, g o ∂μ) = 0)\n    (hgsecond : (∫ o : Ω, (g o) ^ (2 : ℕ) ∂μ) = 1)\n    (y : ℝ) (hy : (1 : ℝ) ≤ y) :\n    (Shao.OQ6.CanonicalDoubleGhostRowMoments.sampleLaw n μ).real\n      {x : Fin n → Ω |\n        Real.sqrt y * Real.rpow (n : ℝ) ((1 : ℝ) / 4) *\n            ((4 : ℝ) + Real.sqrt\n              (Shao.OQ6.OriginalGhostGoodEvent.sampleEnergy n g x / (n : ℝ))) <\n          |Shao.OQ6.OriginalGhostGoodEvent.sampleSum n g x /\n            Real.sqrt (n : ℝ)|} ≤\n      (4 : ℝ) * Real.exp (-(y * Real.sqrt (n : ℝ)) / (2 : ℝ))",
      "headSHA256": "ccf2cfd75a781f4e72bcf4fd8c759bbbc73752835c8cb71a6a848b537deaa03d",
      "headBytes": 798,
      "normalization": "UTF8exactheadwithoutterminalLF",
